      ":question/problem": "Calculate the integral $\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\int\\sech^{2} (\\frac{1x}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.",
